      "title": "Workflow Quick Guide",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Quick guide\n\nLoad four matching views, generate a mesh, and add textures. Save 3D Model exports the textured GLB.\n\nDownload `hunyuan3d-dit-v2-mv_fp16.safetensors` from the model resource below and place it in `ComfyUI/models/checkpoints`.\n\nTexturing requires Linux and an NVIDIA CUDA GPU. Follow the repository README for setup. The first texture run downloads additional models.\n\nURLs are shown as plain text for your security, so you can inspect the full address before opening it.\n\n**Hunyuan nodes and setup**\n```text\nhttps://github.com/defnotkevin/ComfyUI-Hunyuan3d-v2-multiview\n```\n\n**Shape model files**\n```text\nhttps://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/hunyuan3D_2.0_repackaged\n```"
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
